<title>USA: Showers forecast for Brazil coffee area - WSC.</title>
<headline>Showers forecast for Brazil coffee area - WSC.</headline>
<dateline>BEDFORD, Mass. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scattered showers of 0.10-0.50 inch (2-12 mm) fell in the Brazil coffee and citrus areas. Temperatures near to below normal.</p>
<p>Scattered showers of 0.25-0.75 inch (4-20mm) in the Bahia cocoa areas.</p>
<p>Generally favorable conditions for the coffee and citrus trees and the developing and maturing crops.</p>
<p>Outlook - Mostly fair in the coffee and citrus areas Thursday. Partly to variably cloudy skies Friday-Saturday with scattered showers and thunderstorms of 0.25-1.00 inch (5-25mm).</p>
<p>Temperatures near to below normal. Partly cloudy skies Sunday-Monday with the daily chance of a few light showers.</p>
<p>Source - Weather Services Corp.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
